{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/0fc77a379e1dd4eda6dacd147e6d9f7b.avif?t=1756336097\" width=1374 height=616 /></span>Dust Walkers is a Top-Down, relentless\u00a0Action Rogue-like\u00a0with MOBA inspired abilities, and base defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/afe241ff46244d694bcd3efe3cc5890a.avif?t=1756336097\" width=1530 height=178 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own MOBA style character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find guns and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a operation you are able to control up to 3 Dust Walkers at a time, either individually or all together as a squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.poster.avif?t=1756336097\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.webm?t=1756336097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.mp4?t=1756336097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique feature tests your capabilities as a commander. Where only the best are able to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/4c299fae4a3714134c6dc48ae08680d7.avif?t=1756336097\" data-has-big width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new Recruits, and modify them to create the perfect Dust Walker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a deep Research Tree:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Research Tree you will be able to upgrade 3 different areas of gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the recruits section you can upgrade your recruits starting stats, gain new recruits rarities, and unlock new Dust Walker classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the upgrades section you can improve your Dust Walkers operational upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also upgrade your structures and command capabilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1571790?t=1756336097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/3029634368d3fe455423625f490936dc6e3a9220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756336097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/343f6a0313a9c94682607e20a3a72759e93a41a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756336097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/343f6a0313a9c94682607e20a3a72759e93a41a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756336097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players are able to shoot and kill zombie like creatures."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/0fc77a379e1dd4eda6dacd147e6d9f7b.avif?t=1756336097\" width=1374 height=616 /></span>Dust Walkers is a Top-Down, relentless\u00a0Action Rogue-like\u00a0with MOBA inspired abilities, and base defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/afe241ff46244d694bcd3efe3cc5890a.avif?t=1756336097\" width=1530 height=178 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own MOBA style character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find guns and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a operation you are able to control up to 3 Dust Walkers at a time, either individually or all together as a squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.poster.avif?t=1756336097\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.webm?t=1756336097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/e5cccb1c9b10e717dbb1d394f88073e0.mp4?t=1756336097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique feature tests your capabilities as a commander. Where only the best are able to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/4c299fae4a3714134c6dc48ae08680d7.avif?t=1756336097\" data-has-big width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new Recruits, and modify them to create the perfect Dust Walker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a deep Research Tree:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Research Tree you will be able to upgrade 3 different areas of gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the recruits section you can upgrade your recruits starting stats, gain new recruits rarities, and unlock new Dust Walker classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the upgrades section you can improve your Dust Walkers operational upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also upgrade your structures and command capabilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Guide Stone Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/e5870104f590768030207a445e1f73025897d214/header.jpg?t=1756336097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173497,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173497/movie480.mp4?t=1753379379","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173497/movie_max.mp4?t=1753379379"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173497/569fb067